      <data key="d7">["Локальные асимптотики", "Q — норма проводимостей, не энергия", "Не время освоения произвольной новой функции"]</data>
      <data key="d8">Результат заявлен в канонической рукописи; мировой приоритет этим извлечением не проверен.</data>
      <data key="d9">primary_statement_checked</data>
      <data key="d10">[{"path": "PLASTICITY_COST_CLASSES_20261101/PREPRINT_READY_v0_2/manuscript/model.tex", "start": 48, "end": 68, "role": "statement", "name": "model.tex", "excerpt": "48: \\begin{theorem}[Transferable switching and its costs]\\label{thm:main}\n49: For every fixed finite $L\\ge3$ there is a nonempty open set $\\mathcal U_L\\subset\\R_{&gt;0}^{3L}$ such that every $a\\in\\mathcal U_L$ has a mutually reachable positive partner $p$ satisfying\n50: \\begin{equation}\\label{eq:matched}\n51:  (Q,C,K)(a)=(Q,C,K)(p),\n52:  \\qquad\n53:  S_\\delta(a)\\asymp\\delta^{1/3}/U,\\quad\n54:  S_\\delta(p)\\asymp\\sqrt\\delta/U\n55:  \\quad(\\delta\\downarrow0).\n56: \\end{equation}\n57: The construction uses a three-cell terminal module preceded by a fixed finite input prefix. The prefix has longitudinal conductances $\\theta_e/\\epsilon$ and rung conductances $r_e$, with positive $\\theta,r$ near unity and sufficiently small $\\epsilon&gt;0$. Every edge remains trainable under~\\eqref{eq:law}.\n58: \n59: For each fixed admissible prefix, there is a local continuous family $g_s$, $|s|\\le s_0$, with constant full $(Q,C,K)$, for which\n60: \\begin{align}\n61:  S_\\delta(g_s)&amp;\\asymp U^{-1}\\min\\{\\sqrt{\\delta/s},\\delta^{1/3}\\},&amp;&amp;0&lt;s\\le s_0,\\label{eq:jointplus}\\\\\n62:  S_\\delta(g_s)&amp;\\asymp\\delta^{1/3}/U,&amp;&amp;-s_0\\le s\\le0,\\label{eq:jointminus}\\\\\n63:  \\prep(g_{-s},g_s)&amp;\\asymp s^{1/4}/U,&amp;&amp;0&lt;s\\le s_0.\\label{eq:prepmain}\n64: \\end{align}\n65: The constants in the first two estimates are common for $0&lt;\\delta\\le\\delta_0$ and the indicated $s$; those in the third are common for small $s&gt;0$. They may depend on $L$ and the fixed prefix. Neither the threshold on $\\epsilon$ nor the constants or working radii are asserted uniform as $L\\to\\infty$.\n66: \\end{theorem}\n67: \n… Полный диапазон см. в источнике."}]</data>
